  "title": "American Breakfast Casserole",
  "description": "This all-American breakfast casserole is made with frozen hash brown potatoes, bacon, eggs, and a trio of cheeses. Perfect for breakfast and brunch!",
  "authors": [
    "TRISH"
  ],
